				</div>

				<div class="rounded-lg bg-background p-10 text-foreground" data-card data-scrollspy-content>
					<div class="prose max-w-none font-medium text-pretty lg:text-lg">
						<h2>Challenges</h2>
						<ul>
							<li>Time zone delays affecting urgent annuity matters</li>
							<li>Heavy reliance on slow email-based communication</li>
							<li>Lack of local China-based support</li>
							<li>Inflexible workflows and billing structures</li>
							<li>Difficulty supporting multiple legal entities</li>
							<li>Increased operational risk at scale</li>
						</ul>

						<h2>Solutions</h2>
						<ul>
							<li>Dedicated RWS local service team in China</li>
							<li>Customized and flexible renewals workflows</li>
							<li>Faster communication and real-time issue resolution</li>
							<li>Improved compliance and process control</li>
							<li>Scalable support aligned to Alibaba’s growth</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div>
					<div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
