							<p class="text-2xl font-bold text-balance">10-15% improvement in monthly efficiency</p>
						</div>

						<div class="intersect-once grid place-content-center rounded-lg bg-background p-10 text-center text-foreground intersect:motion-preset-expand" style="--motion-delay: 300ms" data-theme="secondary">
