						<p>From the outset, Alibaba experienced strong leadership-level commitment from RWS. The professionalism of RWS’s global renewals team, combined with indispensable local China-based support, immediately differentiated the service.</p>
						<p>RWS tailored solutions to Alibaba’s internal requirements, including customized documentation and billing aligned to different financial systems. Quarterly reminders, automatic payment options, and proactive risk management helped further streamline operations.</p>
						<p>Over time, these improvements led Alibaba to transfer more renewals work from law firms and attorneys to RWS, expanding the scope of the partnership.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Testimonial -->
				<div class="rounded-lg bg-background p-10 text-foreground" data-theme="tertiary">
