							</div>

							<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary mt-8">Get started</a>
						</div>

						<div class="sm:col-span-5">
							<img src="https://placehold.co/1024x768" alt="Placeholder" class="aspect-video size-full rounded object-cover" />
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- CTA with glow -->
				<div hidden class="glow-animate rounded-lg border border-accent/33 bg-background p-10 text-foreground" data-theme="default">
					<div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-12">
						<div class="sm:col-span-7">
							<h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-balance">First time here? Discover what RWS can do!</h3>

							<div class="prose max-w-none font-medium text-pretty lg:text-lg">
								<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Recusandae, necessitatibus impedit id qui suscipit, quas unde dolorum eveniet odio ullam tenetur ipsa expedita vero maiores excepturi rerum ipsam repudiandae doloremque.</p>
							</div>

							<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary mt-8">Get started</a>
						</div>

						<div class="sm:col-span-5">
							<img src="https://placehold.co/1024x768" alt="Placeholder" class="aspect-video size-full rounded object-cover" />
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="rounded-lg bg-background p-10 text-foreground" data-card data-scrollspy-content>
					<div class="prose max-w-none font-medium text-pretty lg:text-lg">
						<p>Today, Alibaba’s IP renewals management is smoother, faster, and more resilient. The removal of time zone and language barriers has significantly reduced communication costs while improving accuracy and responsiveness.</p>
						<p>Looking ahead, Alibaba plans to further expand its partnership with RWS by transferring additional renewals work and exploring broader IP process management services. With shared commitment and aligned expertise, the collaboration is positioned for long-term success.</p>

						<h2>7 key benefits of using a patent annuity service</h2>
						<ul>
							<li>Price stability</li>
							<li>Payment guarantee</li>
							<li>Flexible service options</li>
							<li>Global reach, local presence</li>
							<li>Full IP service provision</li>
							<li>Comprehensive data verification</li>
							<li>Online access to your renewals 24/7</li>
						</ul>
						<p>Learn more about using a <a href="https://www.rws.com/intellectual-property-solutions/patent-renewals">patent annuity service</a></p>
